      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>one step at a time? how? everything that made me *me* was out there. the people i talked to every day, the recognition, the purpose... it was all tied to that digital identity. now it's just empty. it feels like the version of me that actually mattered is already dead. i'm just the leftover shell. it's like i'm a character in a story that got deleted mid-chapter and now i'm just... lingering in the margins. does that even make sense?",
